    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This new land is strange and mysterious. Food seems to rain from the sky, gigantic monoliths tower over the landscape, and ferocious creatures crowd in unimaginable numbers.\u00a0 As Queen, your nest is the only safety your children can count on, and you intend to keep them safe by any means necessary.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946810/extras/7a3face947edb0b66cee76e85b45b407.avif?t=1752312836\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden story for those willing to search for it...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accurate to life ant AI that uses pheromones to navigate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Frantic resource management and combat simultaneously!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > many many many ants. (they each love you wholeheartedly)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > funky music (made by ants, for ants, of ants)!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue like upgrades made from ancient artifacts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovecraftian Horror!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946810/extras/02cfab48f46c4d63277cabcdd3f58498.avif?t=1752312836\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This new land is strange and mysterious. Food seems to rain from the sky, gigantic monoliths tower over the landscape, and ferocious creatures crowd in unimaginable numbers.\u00a0 As Queen, your nest is the only safety your children can count on, and you intend to keep them safe by any means necessary.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946810/extras/7a3face947edb0b66cee76e85b45b407.avif?t=1752312836\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden story for those willing to search for it...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accurate to life ant AI that uses pheromones to navigate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Frantic resource management and combat simultaneously!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > many many many ants. (they each love you wholeheartedly)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > funky music (made by ants, for ants, of ants)!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue like upgrades made from ancient artifacts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovecraftian Horror!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946810/extras/02cfab48f46c4d63277cabcdd3f58498.avif?t=1752312836\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p>",
